6px; color: #111827;\">\n        \ud83d\udd25 New Anbernic <span style=\"color: #3b82f6;\">RG35XX (2024 Version)</span>\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">3.5\" IPS \u2022 H700 Quad-Core \u2022 1GB LPDDR4 \u2022 Linux 64-bit \u2022 HDMI Out</p>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n        \n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Colors</strong><br>Gray / Transparent White / Transparent Purple / Transparent Black\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Display</strong><br>3.5\" IPS Full Viewing Angle<br>OCA Full Lamination \u2022 640 \u00d7 480\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>H700 Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A53 @ 1.5 GHz\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Dual-Core G31 MP2\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>1 GB LPDDR4\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Storage</strong><br>64 GB TF Included<br>Dual TF slots \u2014 Expandable up to 512 GB\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Operating System</strong><br>Linux 64-bit\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Game Support</strong><br>30+ Emulators supported<br>Supports user-downloaded game formats\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Languages</strong><br>EN / CN / JP / KR / RU / FR / DE / ES\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Speaker</strong><br>High-fidelity built-in speaker\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Battery</strong><br>2600 mAh Li-polymer \u2014 up to 7 hours\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Charging</strong><br>5V / 1.5A \u2014 USB-C Charging\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Extra Functions</strong><br>2.4G Wireless &amp; Wired Controller support<br>HDMI TV Output \u2022 Vibration Motor\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Accessories</strong><br>USB-C Cable \u2022 Screen Protector \u2022 User Manual\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Dimensions</strong><br>11.7 \u00d7 8.1 \u00d7 2.2 cm\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Weight</strong><br>186 g\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600;\">Upgraded 2024 Internals \u2022 Pocket-sized Power \u2022 HD TV Output</span>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary based on firmware and region.</p>\n</div>",
